    "escalate_to_human": false
}"}, {"source": "CATERING_AND_CUSTOM_CAKES.md", "quote": "- **Deposit:** 50% non-refundable deposit required at contract signing to reserve the event date. - **Final Balance:** Remaining balance must be paid in full 14 days prior to the event date. - **Cancellations:** - 30+ days prior: deposit retained. - 14–29 days prior: 50% of contract value retained. - Under 14 days: 100% of contract value retained. - **Guest Count Changes:** Final guest count is due 14 days before the event. It can increase by up to 10% within that window, subject to capacity. It cannot decrease after that date."}, {"source": "CATERING_AND_CUSTOM_CAKES.md", "quote": "- **Weddings & Large Events (100+ guests):** Minimum **6 weeks** notice required. Peak-season dates (May–October) close up to 6 months in advance. - **Bespoke Celebratory Cakes:** Minimum **14 days** notice required. - **Small Wholesale Event Trays:** Minimum **7 days** notice required. - **Rush Requests:** We cannot accommodate bookings inside these windows. Our sourdough cake layers and laminated doughs need 18–36 hours of fermentation, and decorating takes more time on top of that."}]

