    "answer": "We deliver Tuesday through Sunday between 4:30 AM and 7:00 AM. Zone A (Urban Core) receives daily drops, and Zone B (Outer Metro) receives drops on Tuesday, Thursday, and Saturday.",
    "escalate_to_human": false
}"}, {"source": "WHOLESALE_ORDERING_GUIDE.md", "quote": "- **Access Requirements:** Partners must supply a reliable keycode or lockbox key for entry. - **Drop Location:** Drops are made directly to the partner's designated walk-in cooler or food-safe staging counter. Fresh bread is placed in breathable paper or cloth bags, never sealed plastic. - **Cold Weather Protection:** From Nov 1 to Apr 1, exterior lockbox drops are strictly prohibited to prevent thermal shock. A staffed or interior access point is required. - **Refrigeration Warning:** Do not refrigerate bread. Cold storage speeds staling (see `BREAD_STORAGE_AND_REVIVAL.md`)."}, {"source": "CATERING_AND_CUSTOM_CAKES.md", "quote": "- **Delivery Fee:** $35.00 within Zone A (Urban Core) and $65.00 within Zone B (Outer Metro). Locations beyond our zones are quoted individually. - **Delivery Window:** We deliver and set up during a 2-hour window agreed in your contract, finishing at least 90 minutes before service. - **Venue Requirements:** A level table, shade, and a clear loading path. A refrigerated space within the venue is strongly recommended for tiered cakes. - **Tiered Cakes:** Cakes of three or more tiers are assembled on site by a staff member, and an on-site fee of $100.00 applies. - **Equipment:** Stands, boards, and linens are provided on loan with a refundable $75.00 deposit. They must be returned within 5 days. - **Closed Mondays:** Delivery and pickup are not available on Mondays."}]

[{"source": "faq_support_knowledgebase.json", "quote": "{
    "id": "FAQ-RET-006",
    "category": "Daily Retail & Orders",
    "question": "I received the wrong item or a damaged loaf in my retail order. What now?",
    "answer": "We're sorry about that. Please bring the item or a photo to the counter, or contact us within 24 hours of pickup, and our team will arrange a replacement or refund.",
    "escalate_to_human": true
