    "escalate_to_human": false
}"}, {"source": "CATERING_AND_CUSTOM_CAKES.md", "quote": "- **Delivery Fee:** $35.00 within Zone A (Urban Core) and $65.00 within Zone B (Outer Metro). Locations beyond our zones are quoted individually. - **Delivery Window:** We deliver and set up during a 2-hour window agreed in your contract, finishing at least 90 minutes before service. - **Venue Requirements:** A level table, shade, and a clear loading path. A refrigerated space within the venue is strongly recommended for tiered cakes. - **Tiered Cakes:** Cakes of three or more tiers are assembled on site by a staff member, and an on-site fee of $100.00 applies. - **Equipment:** Stands, boards, and linens are provided on loan with a refundable $75.00 deposit. They must be returned within 5 days. - **Closed Mondays:** Delivery and pickup are not available on Mondays."}, {"source": "CATERING_AND_CUSTOM_CAKES.md", "quote": "- **Weddings & Large Events (100+ guests):** Minimum **6 weeks** notice required. Peak-season dates (May–October) close up to 6 months in advance. - **Bespoke Celebratory Cakes:** Minimum **14 days** notice required. - **Small Wholesale Event Trays:** Minimum **7 days** notice required. - **Rush Requests:** We cannot accommodate bookings inside these windows. Our sourdough cake layers and laminated doughs need 18–36 hours of fermentation, and decorating takes more time on top of that."}, {"source": "faq_support_knowledgebase.json", "quote": "{
    "id": "FAQ-CAT-004",
