    "answer": "When structural repair would compromise safety or integrity, you receive a 40% trade-in credit toward a replacement item, valid for 12 months. A bench craftsperson makes the repair-versus-replace call and we explain it with photos.",
    "escalate_to_human": true
}"}, {"source": "faq_support_knowledgebase.json", "quote": "{
    "id": "FAQ-MAT-005",
    "category": "Product & Materials",
    "question": "How do I rewax my coat?",
    "answer": "Clean the canvas with cold water and a soft brush, then let it dry. Rub a paraffin/beeswax bar over the weave in circular motions, then melt it in with a hairdryer on medium or a heat gun on low, held 4 to 6 inches away. Cure it in a cool, dry place for 24 hours.",
    "escalate_to_human": false
}"}, {"source": "REPAIR_POLICY.md", "quote": "1. **Photo Triage:** Submit clear photos of the damage (close-up plus full item, in daylight) through the customer intake portal. 2. **RMA Issuance:** Receive a Return Merchandise Authorization (RMA) number within **24 hours** (business hours, Mon–Fri). Write the RMA number on the outside of the box. 3. **Incoming Shipping:** Ship the gear to our bench workshop. The customer covers incoming shipping. 4. **Bench Repair:** Our craftsmen repair the item using original heavy-gauge thread and solid brass hardware. Average repair cycle is **10–14 business days** from receipt. 5. **Return Shipping:** The restored item is returned with complimentary ground freight (typically 3 to 7 days, depending on where you are). **Before You Ship** - Empty the pockets and remove personal items. - Do not wash the garment. Dirty is fine. Washing can hide or worsen the damage. - Pack in a sturdy box or mailer. We recommend tracked shipping with insurance."}, {"source": "CARE_GUIDE.md", "quote": "| Mistake | What Happens | Fix | | :--- | :--- | :--- | | Washing a waxed coat in a machine | Wax strips out, water resistance gone | Rewax (Section 2) | | Drying boots by a fire | Leather shrinks and cracks | Replace; prevention only | | Over-oiling | Leather goes soft and sags | Let it rest and don't oil again for 6 months | | Storing damp | Mold and mildew | Brush off, dry, and see `REPAIR_POLICY.md` for exclusions | *Table Summary:* [5. Common Mistakes] - Mistake: Washing a waxed coat in a machine | What Happens: Wax strips out, water resistance gone | Fix: Rewax (Section 2) - Mistake: Drying boots by a fire | What Happens: Leather shrinks and cracks | Fix: Replace; prevention only - Mistake: Over-oiling | What Happens: Leather goes soft and sags | Fix: Let it rest and don't oil again for 6 months - Mistake: Storing damp | What Happens: Mold and mildew | Fix: Brush off, dry, and see REPAIR_POLICY.md for exclusions Need help? Contact our support team, and we'll walk you through it."}]

[{"source": "faq_support_knowledgebase.json", "quote": "{
    "id": "FAQ-WHO-003",
    "category": "Wholesale & B2B",
    "question": "What payment terms and lead times do you offer for commercial accounts?",
    "answer": "Net-30 terms after an approved credit evaluation, with a 50% deposit required on custom co-branded batches. Standard manufacturing lead time is 4 to 6 weeks from deposit or PO approval.",
    "escalate_to_human": false
}"}, {"source": "faq_support_knowledgebase.json", "quote": "{
    "id": "FAQ-ORD-004",
    "category": "Orders & Shipping",
    "question": "Which items can't be returned?",
    "answer": "Custom monogrammed leather goods, altered sleeve hems, factory seconds, archived sale batches marked Final Sale, and gift cards. These are still covered by the Heritage Guarantee for defects.",
    "escalate_to_human": false
}"}, {"source": "WHOLESALE_SOP.md", "quote": "1. Submit the commercial account application (business name, EIN, resale certificate or tax-exempt form if applicable, and trade references). 2. Credit check and review: **3 to 5 business days**. 3. Account manager assigned and portal access granted. Tax-exempt buyers must provide a valid certificate before invoicing. Orders shipped without a certificate are taxed where applicable."}, {"source": "WHOLESALE_SOP.md", "quote": "- **Standard Terms:** **Net-30** upon approved credit evaluation. New accounts may begin with a credit limit of $5,000 and increase after 6 months of on-time payment. - **Customized Batches:** **50% deposit** is required on custom co-branded production batches, with the balance due Net-30 from shipment. - **Payment Methods:** ACH, wire, or check. Credit cards are accepted for orders under $2,500 with a 3% processing fee. - **Late Payments:** A 1.5% monthly fee applies after 30 days. Accounts more than 45 days past due are placed on hold."}]

[{"source": "faq_support_knowledgebase.json", "quote": "{
    "id": "FAQ-ORD-002",
    "category": "Orders & Shipping",
    "question": "What is your return policy?",
    "answer": "A 45-day field trial. Return unwashed items in original condition with tags attached for a full refund to your original payment method. There are no restocking fees, and inspections are done within 3 business days of receipt. Domestic return shipping is $7.95 deducted from the refund, except for exchanges and defects.",
    "escalate_to_human": false
}"}, {"source": "RETURNS_AND_EXCHANGES.md", "quote": "The following are non-returnable and excluded from refund policies: - Custom monogrammed leather goods. - Altered sleeve hems and any other custom tailoring. - Factory seconds. - Archived sale batches, labeled "Final Sale" at checkout. - Gift cards. Monogrammed or hemmed items are still covered by the Heritage Guarantee for defects."}, {"source": "sizing_specs.json", "quote": "custom_tailoring_disclaimer:
{
    "sleeve_hem_requests": "Custom sleeve hemming is available on request on outerwear, in 0.5 inch increments, up to 3 inches shorter.",
    "impact_on_returns": "Items with altered sleeve hems are final sale and excluded from the 45-day field trial return window.",
    "lead_time_days": "Add 5 to 7 business days to standard order processing."
}"}, {"source": "faq_support_knowledgebase.json", "quote": "{
    "id": "FAQ-ORD-005",
    "category": "Orders & Shipping",
    "question": "My package arrived damaged or with the wrong item.",
    "answer": "Contact us within 14 days of delivery with photos. We ship a replacement or refund in full with free return shipping.",
    "escalate_to_human": true
}"}]

[{"source": "faq_support_knowledgebase.json", "quote": "{
    "id": "FAQ-WHO-001",
    "category": "Wholesale & B2B",
    "question": "Can we deboss our company logo onto wholesale leather field notebooks?",
    "answer": "Yes. We offer custom hot-stamp debossing on orders meeting our Tier 1 MOQ of 25 units. A one-time $150 brass die tooling fee applies, and artwork must be supplied as a vectorized PDF or AI file.",
    "escalate_to_human": false
}"}, {"source": "WHOLESALE_SOP.md", "quote": "Hot-stamp custom logo debossing is available across all leather goods. Co-branded apparel patches are available for Tier 2 and 3 accounts. - **Artwork:** Vector files (.AI or .PDF) are required. Raster files (JPG/PNG) are not accepted. - **Tool-and-Die Fee:** A one-time **$150 tool-and-die brass mold fee** applies per custom artwork submission. Reorders using the same die are free. - **Size Limits:** Maximum deboss area is **2.5 in. × 1.25 in.** on belts and **3 in. × 3 in.** on notebooks and wallets. Minimum line weight is 0.5 pt (1 mm gap between elements). - **Stamp Temperature:** Stamps are applied at roughly **230°F–260°F (110°C–127°C)**. - **Proof Approval:** A digital proof is sent within 3 business days of artwork receipt, and a physical sample deboss is available for $35.00. Production starts only after written proof approval. - **Brand Compliance:** We reserve the right to decline artwork that infringes a trademark or conflicts with our brand. - Custom branded goods are **final sale**."}, {"source": "faq_support_knowledgebase.json", "quote": "{
    "id": "FAQ-WHO-002",
    "category": "Wholesale & B2B",
    "question": "What are your wholesale tiers and discounts?",
    "answer": "Tier 1 is 25 to 99 units at 40% off MSRP. Tier 2 is 100 to 499 units at 48% off. Tier 3 is 500 or more units at 55% off. Mixed SKUs count toward the tier.",
    "escalate_to_human": false
}"}, {"source": "sizing_specs.json", "quote": "custom_tailoring_disclaimer:
{
    "sleeve_hem_requests": "Custom sleeve hemming is available on request on outerwear, in 0.5 inch increments, up to 3 inches shorter.",
    "impact_on_returns": "Items with altered sleeve hems are final sale and excluded from the 45-day field trial return window.",
    "lead_time_days": "Add 5 to 7 business days to standard order processing."
}"}]

