    "question": "Can we deboss our company logo onto wholesale leather field notebooks?",
    "answer": "Yes. We offer custom hot-stamp debossing on orders meeting our Tier 1 MOQ of 25 units. A one-time $150 brass die tooling fee applies, and artwork must be supplied as a vectorized PDF or AI file.",
    "escalate_to_human": false
}"}, {"source": "WHOLESALE_SOP.md", "quote": "| Tier | Quantity (units per order) | Discount off MSRP | | :--- | :--- | :--- | | **Tier 1** | 25–99 units | 40% | | **Tier 2** | 100–499 units | 48% | | **Tier 3** | 500+ units | 55% | *Table Summary:* [1. Tiered Minimum Order Quantities (MOQ)] - Tier: Tier 1 | Quantity (units per order): 25–99 units | Discount off MSRP: 40% - Tier: Tier 2 | Quantity (units per order): 100–499 units | Discount off MSRP: 48% - Tier: Tier 3 | Quantity (units per order): 500+ units | Discount off MSRP: 55% - A "unit" is one finished item (one coat, one belt, one pair of pants). Mixed SKUs may be combined to reach a tier. - Orders of fewer than 25 units are not wholesale and are handled through retail or a gift program. - Tier pricing is locked for **12 months** from account approval, and Tier 2 and 3 accounts can set blanket orders with scheduled releases. - **Sample Program:** Up to 3 sample units are available at Tier 1 pricing, credited back if a first order of 25+ units is placed within 60 days."}]

[{"source": "faq_support_knowledgebase.json", "quote": "{
