}"}, {"source": "WHOLESALE_SOP.md", "quote": "| Tier | Quantity (units per order) | Discount off MSRP | | :--- | :--- | :--- | | **Tier 1** | 25–99 units | 40% | | **Tier 2** | 100–499 units | 48% | | **Tier 3** | 500+ units | 55% | *Table Summary:* [1. Tiered Minimum Order Quantities (MOQ)] - Tier: Tier 1 | Quantity (units per order): 25–99 units | Discount off MSRP: 40% - Tier: Tier 2 | Quantity (units per order): 100–499 units | Discount off MSRP: 48% - Tier: Tier 3 | Quantity (units per order): 500+ units | Discount off MSRP: 55% - A "unit" is one finished item (one coat, one belt, one pair of pants). Mixed SKUs may be combined to reach a tier. - Orders of fewer than 25 units are not wholesale and are handled through retail or a gift program. - Tier pricing is locked for **12 months** from account approval, and Tier 2 and 3 accounts can set blanket orders with scheduled releases. - **Sample Program:** Up to 3 sample units are available at Tier 1 pricing, credited back if a first order of 25+ units is placed within 60 days."}, {"source": "RETURNS_AND_EXCHANGES.md", "quote": "Complimentary prepaid digital shipping labels are generated automatically via our customer portal for all domestic size and color exchanges. - We ship the replacement when the carrier shows your original item in transit **if** your account is in good standing, or when we receive it. - If the replacement costs more, we charge the difference. If it costs less, we refund the difference. - One free exchange per item. Further exchanges carry a $7.95 shipping charge. - Exchanges are subject to stock availability. If your size is out, we refund in full."}]

