[{"source": "REPAIR_POLICY.md", "quote": "| Item | Who Pays | | :--- | :--- | | Incoming shipping to workshop | Customer | | Repair labor and materials (covered) | Iron & Oak | | Return ground shipping (U.S. contiguous) | Iron & Oak | | Expedited return shipping (2-day / overnight) | Customer, at carrier rates | | International return shipping | Customer | *Table Summary:* [3. Shipping & Turnaround Rules] - Item: Incoming shipping to workshop | Who Pays: Customer - Item: Repair labor and materials (covered) | Who Pays: Iron & Oak - Item: Return ground shipping (U.S. contiguous) | Who Pays: Iron & Oak - Item: Expedited return shipping (2-day / overnight) | Who Pays: Customer, at carrier rates - Item: International return shipping | Who Pays: Customer - **Repair Time:** 10–14 business days is the average. Peak periods (October through December) can add up to **5 additional business days**, and we will tell you when you get your RMA. - **Updates:** You receive an email on receipt, when repair begins, and when the item ships. - **Unclaimed Items:** Items that remain unclaimed 60 days after repair notification are donated or recycled."}, {"source": "sizing_specs.json", "quote": "sizing_metadata:
