}"}, {"source": "RETURNS_AND_EXCHANGES.md", "quote": "Test your gear for up to **45 days** from the delivery date. Items returned in **unwashed, original condition with tags attached** receive full refunds to the original payment method. **Eligible:** - Unwashed and unaltered. Light try-on and trail testing is fine. - Original tags attached. - Returned within 45 days of delivery. **Not Eligible:** - Washed, soiled, stained, or damaged items. (If gear fails from defects, use `REPAIR_POLICY.md` instead.) - Items with pet hair, strong odor, or smoke."}, {"source": "sizing_specs.json", "quote": "custom_tailoring_disclaimer:
