    "question": "How long does shipping take?",
    "answer": "Standard ground is 3 to 7 business days, free over $150.00 and $9.95 otherwise. Expedited 2-day is $24.95 and overnight is $39.95. Orders placed before 2:00 PM Mountain, Monday through Friday, ship the same or next business day.",
    "escalate_to_human": false
}"}, {"source": "RETURNS_AND_EXCHANGES.md", "quote": "| Service | Delivery Time | Cost | | :--- | :--- | :--- | | Standard Ground | 3 to 7 business days | Free over $150.00; otherwise $9.95 | | Expedited 2-Day | 2 business days | $24.95 | | Overnight | 1 business day | $39.95 | *Table Summary:* [7. Orders & Shipping Reference] - Service: Standard Ground | Delivery Time: 3 to 7 business days | Cost: Free over $150.00; otherwise $9.95 - Service: Expedited 2-Day | Delivery Time: 2 business days | Cost: $24.95 - Service: Overnight | Delivery Time: 1 business day | Cost: $39.95 Orders placed before 2:00 PM Mountain, Monday–Friday, ship the same or next business day. Custom orders ship in 10 to 15 business days."}, {"source": "RETURNS_AND_EXCHANGES.md", "quote": "Complimentary prepaid digital shipping labels are generated automatically via our customer portal for all domestic size and color exchanges. - We ship the replacement when the carrier shows your original item in transit **if** your account is in good standing, or when we receive it. - If the replacement costs more, we charge the difference. If it costs less, we refund the difference. - One free exchange per item. Further exchanges carry a $7.95 shipping charge. - Exchanges are subject to stock availability. If your size is out, we refund in full."}]

[{"source": "faq_support_knowledgebase.json", "quote": "{
