    "id": "FAQ-SIZ-005",
    "category": "Sizing & Fit",
    "question": "Can I get my sleeves hemmed, and can I return a hemmed coat?",
    "answer": "Custom sleeve hemming is available in 0.5 inch increments, up to 3 inches shorter, and adds 5 to 7 business days. Altered items are final sale and excluded from the 45-day return window, so be sure of your measurements first.",
    "escalate_to_human": false
}"}, {"source": "sizing_specs.json", "quote": "custom_tailoring_disclaimer:
{
    "sleeve_hem_requests": "Custom sleeve hemming is available on request on outerwear, in 0.5 inch increments, up to 3 inches shorter.",
    "impact_on_returns": "Items with altered sleeve hems are final sale and excluded from the 45-day field trial return window.",
    "lead_time_days": "Add 5 to 7 business days to standard order processing."
}"}]

[{"source": "faq_support_knowledgebase.json", "quote": "{
    "id": "FAQ-SIZ-005",
    "category": "Sizing & Fit",
    "question": "Can I get my sleeves hemmed, and can I return a hemmed coat?",
    "answer": "Custom sleeve hemming is available in 0.5 inch increments, up to 3 inches shorter, and adds 5 to 7 business days. Altered items are final sale and excluded from the 45-day return window, so be sure of your measurements first.",
    "escalate_to_human": false
}"}, {"source": "faq_support_knowledgebase.json", "quote": "{
    "id": "FAQ-ORD-005",
    "category": "Orders & Shipping",
    "question": "My package arrived damaged or with the wrong item.",
    "answer": "Contact us within 14 days of delivery with photos. We ship a replacement or refund in full with free return shipping.",
    "escalate_to_human": true
}"}, {"source": "REPAIR_POLICY.md", "quote": "1. **Photo Triage:** Submit clear photos of the damage (close-up plus full item, in daylight) through the customer intake portal. 2. **RMA Issuance:** Receive a Return Merchandise Authorization (RMA) number within **24 hours** (business hours, Mon–Fri). Write the RMA number on the outside of the box. 3. **Incoming Shipping:** Ship the gear to our bench workshop. The customer covers incoming shipping. 4. **Bench Repair:** Our craftsmen repair the item using original heavy-gauge thread and solid brass hardware. Average repair cycle is **10–14 business days** from receipt. 5. **Return Shipping:** The restored item is returned with complimentary ground freight (typically 3 to 7 days, depending on where you are). **Before You Ship** - Empty the pockets and remove personal items. - Do not wash the garment. Dirty is fine. Washing can hide or worsen the damage. - Pack in a sturdy box or mailer. We recommend tracked shipping with insurance."}, {"source": "RETURNS_AND_EXCHANGES.md", "quote": "If you receive the wrong item or one damaged in transit, contact us within **14 days** of delivery with photos. We ship a replacement or refund in full, with free return shipping."}]

[{"source": "faq_support_knowledgebase.json", "quote": "{
    "id": "FAQ-SIZ-003",
    "category": "Sizing & Fit",
    "question": "What are the chest measurements for the Timberline Waxed Chore Coat?",
    "answer": "Garment chest measurements are S 42 in., M 45 in., L 48 in., XL 51 in., and the range extends from XS (39 in.) to 3XL (57 in.). Sleeve lengths run from 33.5 in. in XS to 38 in. in 3XL.",
    "escalate_to_human": false
}"}, {"source": "WHOLESALE_SOP.md", "quote": "- **Manufacturing Lead Time:** Standard **4 to 6 weeks** production window from deposit receipt (or PO approval) to freight delivery. - **In-Stock Items:** Ship within 5 business days. - **Custom Co-Branded Orders:** 4 to 6 weeks after proof approval and deposit. - **Freight:** LTL freight for orders over 150 lb. Small-parcel ground for smaller shipments. Freight is prepaid and billed on the invoice, or the customer may use their own carrier. - **Freight Free Threshold:** Tier 3 orders ship freight-free within the contiguous U.S. - **Receiving:** Inspect and note damage on the bill of lading. Report shortages within **7 days** of delivery."}, {"source": "WHOLESALE_SOP.md", "quote": "| Tier | Quantity (units per order) | Discount off MSRP | | :--- | :--- | :--- | | **Tier 1** | 25–99 units | 40% | | **Tier 2** | 100–499 units | 48% | | **Tier 3** | 500+ units | 55% | *Table Summary:* [1. Tiered Minimum Order Quantities (MOQ)] - Tier: Tier 1 | Quantity (units per order): 25–99 units | Discount off MSRP: 40% - Tier: Tier 2 | Quantity (units per order): 100–499 units | Discount off MSRP: 48% - Tier: Tier 3 | Quantity (units per order): 500+ units | Discount off MSRP: 55% - A "unit" is one finished item (one coat, one belt, one pair of pants). Mixed SKUs may be combined to reach a tier. - Orders of fewer than 25 units are not wholesale and are handled through retail or a gift program. - Tier pricing is locked for **12 months** from account approval, and Tier 2 and 3 accounts can set blanket orders with scheduled releases. - **Sample Program:** Up to 3 sample units are available at Tier 1 pricing, credited back if a first order of 25+ units is placed within 60 days."}, {"source": "faq_support_knowledgebase.json", "quote": "{
    "id": "FAQ-WHO-002",
    "category": "Wholesale & B2B",
    "question": "What are your wholesale tiers and discounts?",
    "answer": "Tier 1 is 25 to 99 units at 40% off MSRP. Tier 2 is 100 to 499 units at 48% off. Tier 3 is 500 or more units at 55% off. Mixed SKUs count toward the tier.",
    "escalate_to_human": false
}"}]

