    "category": "Wholesale & B2B",
    "question": "Do you handle corporate gifting and tax-exempt purchases?",
    "answer": "Yes, for orders of 25 or more units. Tax-exempt buyers must provide a valid certificate before invoicing. Your account manager will help with gift packaging and delivery schedules.",
    "escalate_to_human": true
}"}, {"source": "WHOLESALE_SOP.md", "quote": "- **Manufacturing Lead Time:** Standard **4 to 6 weeks** production window from deposit receipt (or PO approval) to freight delivery. - **In-Stock Items:** Ship within 5 business days. - **Custom Co-Branded Orders:** 4 to 6 weeks after proof approval and deposit. - **Freight:** LTL freight for orders over 150 lb. Small-parcel ground for smaller shipments. Freight is prepaid and billed on the invoice, or the customer may use their own carrier. - **Freight Free Threshold:** Tier 3 orders ship freight-free within the contiguous U.S. - **Receiving:** Inspect and note damage on the bill of lading. Report shortages within **7 days** of delivery."}]

