[{"source": "faq_support_knowledgebase.json", "quote": "{
    "id": "FAQ-WHO-002",
    "category": "Wholesale & B2B",
    "question": "What are your wholesale tiers and discounts?",
    "answer": "Tier 1 is 25 to 99 units at 40% off MSRP. Tier 2 is 100 to 499 units at 48% off. Tier 3 is 500 or more units at 55% off. Mixed SKUs count toward the tier.",
    "escalate_to_human": false
}"}, {"source": "faq_support_knowledgebase.json", "quote": "{
    "id": "FAQ-REP-003",
    "category": "Warranty & Repair",
    "question": "Who pays for shipping on a repair?",
    "answer": "You cover the incoming shipping to our workshop. We cover repair labor, materials, and return ground shipping. Expedited return shipping is available at carrier rates.",
    "escalate_to_human": false
}"}, {"source": "WHOLESALE_SOP.md", "quote": "- **Manufacturing Lead Time:** Standard **4 to 6 weeks** production window from deposit receipt (or PO approval) to freight delivery. - **In-Stock Items:** Ship within 5 business days. - **Custom Co-Branded Orders:** 4 to 6 weeks after proof approval and deposit. - **Freight:** LTL freight for orders over 150 lb. Small-parcel ground for smaller shipments. Freight is prepaid and billed on the invoice, or the customer may use their own carrier. - **Freight Free Threshold:** Tier 3 orders ship freight-free within the contiguous U.S. - **Receiving:** Inspect and note damage on the bill of lading. Report shortages within **7 days** of delivery."}, {"source": "WHOLESALE_SOP.md", "quote": "| Tier | Quantity (units per order) | Discount off MSRP | | :--- | :--- | :--- | | **Tier 1** | 25–99 units | 40% | | **Tier 2** | 100–499 units | 48% | | **Tier 3** | 500+ units | 55% | *Table Summary:* [1. Tiered Minimum Order Quantities (MOQ)] - Tier: Tier 1 | Quantity (units per order): 25–99 units | Discount off MSRP: 40% - Tier: Tier 2 | Quantity (units per order): 100–499 units | Discount off MSRP: 48% - Tier: Tier 3 | Quantity (units per order): 500+ units | Discount off MSRP: 55% - A "unit" is one finished item (one coat, one belt, one pair of pants). Mixed SKUs may be combined to reach a tier. - Orders of fewer than 25 units are not wholesale and are handled through retail or a gift program. - Tier pricing is locked for **12 months** from account approval, and Tier 2 and 3 accounts can set blanket orders with scheduled releases. - **Sample Program:** Up to 3 sample units are available at Tier 1 pricing, credited back if a first order of 25+ units is placed within 60 days."}]

