    "answer": "Net-30 terms after an approved credit evaluation, with a 50% deposit required on custom co-branded batches. Standard manufacturing lead time is 4 to 6 weeks from deposit or PO approval.",
    "escalate_to_human": false
}"}, {"source": "WHOLESALE_SOP.md", "quote": "- Wholesale orders are **final sale** except for manufacturing defects reported within 30 days. - The Heritage Guarantee covers the end user. Defective units may be repaired under `REPAIR_POLICY.md`, or credited against a future order. - Retail partners must not describe products or the guarantee in ways that differ from our published terms."}, {"source": "RETURNS_AND_EXCHANGES.md", "quote": "1. Open the customer portal and select **Start a Return** with your order number. 2. Choose Return or Exchange and a reason. 3. Print the prepaid label (domestic) or show the QR code at a carrier drop-off. 4. Pack the item with tags and ship within 7 days of generating the label. 5. Track your return through the portal. - **Domestic Returns:** Return shipping is deducted from refunds ($7.95 flat), except for exchanges and defective items, which are free. - **International Returns:** Customer pays return shipping, and duties and taxes are not refundable."}]

