}"}, {"source": "RETURNS_AND_EXCHANGES.md", "quote": "The following are non-returnable and excluded from refund policies: - Custom monogrammed leather goods. - Altered sleeve hems and any other custom tailoring. - Factory seconds. - Archived sale batches, labeled "Final Sale" at checkout. - Gift cards. Monogrammed or hemmed items are still covered by the Heritage Guarantee for defects."}, {"source": "RETURNS_AND_EXCHANGES.md", "quote": "Complimentary prepaid digital shipping labels are generated automatically via our customer portal for all domestic size and color exchanges. - We ship the replacement when the carrier shows your original item in transit **if** your account is in good standing, or when we receive it. - If the replacement costs more, we charge the difference. If it costs less, we refund the difference. - One free exchange per item. Further exchanges carry a $7.95 shipping charge. - Exchanges are subject to stock availability. If your size is out, we refund in full."}]

