    "question": "Do you clean unsealed marble or antique wood furniture?",
    "answer": "During your initial walkthrough, our team maps all sensitive surfaces. We use pH-neutral saponified soap washes for hardwood and unsealed stone. We strictly prohibit the use of acidic descalers on marble, limestone, or terrazzo to prevent etching.",
    "escalate_to_human": false
}"}, {"source": "POST_CONSTRUCTION_REMEDIATION_GUIDE.md", "quote": "| Stage | Timing | | :--- | :--- | | Rough clean (Phase 1) | After trade work, before final painting touch-ups | | Final clean (Phases 2–3) | After all trades are done, no earlier than 24–48 hours after last sanding | | Touch-up visit | Within 7 days of the final clean, if needed | *Table Summary:* [5. Scheduling] - Stage: Rough clean (Phase 1) | Timing: After trade work, before final painting touch-ups - Stage: Final clean (Phases 2–3) | Timing: After all trades are done, no earlier than 24–48 hours after last sanding - Stage: Touch-up visit | Timing: Within 7 days of the final clean, if needed Dust can resettle for several days after finishing, which is why a short touch-up visit is offered."}, {"source": "WALKTHROUGH_AND_INTAKE_SOP.md", "quote": "| Item | Recorded | | :--- | :--- | | Square footage by room | Yes | | Floor types by room | Yes | | Sensitive surfaces | Yes | | Pre-existing damage (photo log) | Yes | | Pets, infants, allergies | Yes | | Access method and alarm details | Yes (encrypted) | | Parking and loading | Yes | | Water and power access | Yes | | Client-supplied cleaning products | Note: not used unless approved | *Table Summary:* [3. Walkthrough Checklist] - Item: Square footage by room | Recorded: Yes - Item: Floor types by room | Recorded: Yes - Item: Sensitive surfaces | Recorded: Yes - Item: Pre-existing damage (photo log) | Recorded: Yes - Item: Pets, infants, allergies | Recorded: Yes - Item: Access method and alarm details | Recorded: Yes (encrypted) - Item: Parking and loading | Recorded: Yes - Item: Water and power access | Recorded: Yes - Item: Client-supplied cleaning products | Recorded: Note: not used unless approved"}]

