    "answer": "Yes. Our turnover service takes about 110 minutes per 1,000 sq ft per technician and includes laundering linens with hypoallergenic wash, hotel-standard bed making, restocking amenities, sanitizing high-touch surfaces, and checking for left-behind property, with photos sent when finished.",
    "escalate_to_human": false
}"}, {"source": "WALKTHROUGH_AND_INTAKE_SOP.md", "quote": "All recurring service contracts must undergo a foundational **Initial Deep Clean**. This baseline visit removes pre-existing buildup, limescale, and synthetic wax residues from previous chemical cleaners before beginning botanical maintenance. - **Duration:** Typically **2.0x to 2.5x** the standard maintenance time for the same square footage (for example, a 2,000 sq ft home that takes 150 minutes for maintenance will take about 5 to 6.25 hours of technician time for the deep clean). - **Added Tasks:** Interior oven and refrigerator, baseboards, door casings, window sills and tracks, cabinet interiors on request, descaling of fixtures, and detailed grout work. - **Why It Is Mandatory:** Botanical chemistry cannot lift old synthetic residues on its own, and the baseline sets a measurable standard for every visit after it. - **Short-Term Rental Properties:** A baseline deep clean is required before the first turnover. - **Pricing:** Quoted as a fixed price at the walkthrough. Rates are not charged beyond the quote unless conditions differ from the photos, and the client approves any change first."}]

[{"source": "faq_support_knowledgebase.json", "quote": "{
    "id": "FAQ-ECO-002",
    "category": "Chemical Safety & Eco-Standards",
    "question": "What ingredients do you use?",
    "answer": "Bio-Shield Disinfectant uses 0.05% thymol, OxyPure uses stabilized 3% hydrogen peroxide, Citrus-Loom Descaler uses 8% food-grade citric acid, and PureLoom Floor Wash is a saponified coconut and olive oil soap. We provide Safety Data Sheets for every product on request.",
    "escalate_to_human": false
}"}, {"source": "CHEMICAL_SAFETY_AND_SDS_GUIDE.md", "quote": "Kettle & Loom exclusively deploys EPA Design for the Environment (DfE) and Green Seal certified cleaning chemistry: | Product / Formulation | Active Botanical Base | Target Pathogens / Soils | Dwell Time Required | | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | | **Bio-Shield Hospital Disinfectant** | Thymol (0.05% botanical thyme extract) | 99.99% bacteria, enveloped viruses, fungi (per label claims) | 10 minutes (wet dwell) | | **OxyPure Multi-Surface Cleaner** | Hydrogen Peroxide (stabilized 3%) | Soap scum, organic grease, protein soils | 3 minutes | | **Citrus-Loom Mineral Descaler** | Organic Citric Acid (food-grade 8%) | Hard water scale, calcium deposits, rust | 5 minutes | | **PureLoom Floor Wash** | Saponified Coconut & Olive Oil Soap | Hardwood, engineered plank, stone tiles | Immediate mop dry | *Table Summary:* [1. Approved Botanical Formulations & Active Ingredients] - Product / Formulation: Bio-Shield Hospital Disinfectant | Active Botanical Base: Thymol (0.05% botanical thyme extract) | Target Pathogens / Soils: 99.99% bacteria, enveloped viruses, fungi (per label claims) | Dwell Time Required: 10 minutes (wet dwell) - Product / Formulation: OxyPure Multi-Surface Cleaner | Active Botanical Base: Hydrogen Peroxide (stabilized 3%) | Target Pathogens / Soils: Soap scum, organic grease, protein soils | Dwell Time Required: 3 minutes - Product / Formulation: Citrus-Loom Mineral Descaler | Active Botanical Base: Organic Citric Acid (food-grade 8%) | Target Pathogens / Soils: Hard water scale, calcium deposits, rust | Dwell Time Required: 5 minutes - Product / Formulation: PureLoom Floor Wash | Active Botanical Base: Saponified Coconut & Olive Oil Soap | Target Pathogens / Soils: Hardwood, engineered plank, stone tiles | Dwell Time Required: Immediate mop dry"}, {"source": "faq_support_knowledgebase.json", "quote": "{
    "id": "FAQ-ECO-001",
    "category": "Chemical Safety & Eco-Standards",
    "question": "Are your cleaning products safe for homes with infants and pets?",
    "answer": "Our products are zero-VOC, plant- or mineral-derived, and EPA Design for the Environment (DfE) and Green Seal certified. Our hospital-grade disinfectant uses 0.05% thymol, a thyme extract, and kills 99.99% of bacteria and enveloped viruses on a 10-minute wet dwell. Botanical does not mean harmless, so we ask that pets and infants stay out of a room until surfaces dry.",
    "escalate_to_human": false
}"}]

